  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Shape: Bound Bow"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This shape will cause the spell (or spell staff/book) to coalesce into a bound bow. \n\nThe components will be applied to whatever mob I hit with its arrows. The bow has a "
        },
        {
          "text": "constant minor mana drain, unless I am wearing a ",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "Battlemage Amulet",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and "
        },
        {
          "text": "consumes a burst of mana with each arrow fired",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". However, the arrows are made of pure mana and "
        },
        {
          "text": "don't require nor consume any arrows from my pack",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nTo return the bow to a spell, drop it on the ground.  It will automatically revert if I run out of mana."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
